Package: predsenselinux
Version: 0.1.12
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: adduser, init-system-helpers, python3, python3-tk, systemd, util-linux
Maintainer: PredSenseLinux contributors
Description: Acer Predator and Nitro control center for Linux
 PredSenseLinux provides a desktop control center for supported Acer laptops
 using the Linuwu-Sense kernel module. It includes fan, profile, four-zone
 keyboard lighting, battery and firmware controls.
